==========================================================================================

What: the complete diff of PR #30306 ("dory support for llama.cpp", Brian Chmiel / NVIDIA),
as of its head commit 43e865ec059a35d57f1167eaea76ca187077f063 (2026-10-15), against the
stock llama.cpp commit it was last merged with:

  base  6e66cb5d4e9a2b4f02820a9f3053422b92ec4d51  (ggml-org/llama.cpp master, 2026-10-15)
  head  43e865ec059a35d57f1167eaea76ca187077f063  (= refs/pull/30306/head)

  git diff 6e66cb5d4e9a2b4f02820a9f3053422b92ec4d51 43e865ec059a35d57f1167eaea76ca187077f063

Kept here so this repo can rebuild the exact engine its Dory measurements were made with,
even if the PR is rewritten, closed or merged differently. Apply it with
scripts/build-llama-cuda.sh (LLAMA_REF=<base> PATCH=<this file>); docs/dory-on-8gb.md
